## Third-Party Components

This software may use or interact with the following third-party components:

### LibreHardwareMonitor
- **License**: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL-2.0)
- **Project**: https://github.com/LibreHardwareMonitor/LibreHardwareMonitor
- **Usage**: Windows hardware sensor monitoring (optional dependency)
- **Note**: LibreHardwareMonitor is a separate project and is not included in this repository.
  Users must download it separately as per the installation instructions.

### lm-sensors
- **License**: GNU GPL v2+
- **Project**: https://github.com/lm-sensors/lm-sensors
- **Usage**: Linux hardware sensor monitoring (optional dependency)
- **Note**: lm-sensors is installed via system package managers and is not bundled with this project.

### osx-cpu-temp
- **License**: GPL v3
- **Project**: https://github.com/lavoiesl/osx-cpu-temp
- **Usage**: macOS CPU temperature monitoring (optional fallback dependency)
- **Note**: osx-cpu-temp is installed via Homebrew and is not bundled with this project.

### NinjaRMM
- **Service**: NinjaRMM remote monitoring and management platform
- **Website**: https://www.ninjarmm.com/
- **Usage**: Required platform for script deployment and data collection
- **Note**: This project requires an active NinjaRMM subscription and agent deployment.
  This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by NinjaRMM.

